{
	title: 'Tune italic size x-height and character stride in the font demo',
	spec: 'The /demo/fonts page defaults to Source Code Pro Light at 14px with x-height matching off. Live controls tune reference Plex size, italic font size, target x-height, character stride and independent upright/italic line heights in pixels (both start at 21px). Matching x-height changes italic size; matching stride changes letter-spacing without stretching glyphs. Compare identical text directly side by side on shared baselines, on adjacent alternating lines, and in sentences mixing upright and italic spans. Horizontally scrollable 539-character rulers have end markers and report both actual DOM widths and their difference. Show measured font metrics and resulting CSS beside the existing real-style cards. Demo changes do not affect the main app or track font binaries.',
