	notes: [
		'X-height matching starts off: Source Code Pro Light uses 14px and natural spacing so the user can keep its preferred baseline alignment. Verified in headless Chrome: default x-height 6.72px/stride 8.40px; match upright Plex x-height gives 15.05px text and 7.22px x-height; stride matching at 16px uses -1.20px letter-spacing; manual 7px x-height and 8.8px stride work; thinking collapse still works. Upright Plex remains unchanged. Font size and x-height are coupled; stride is adjusted with letter-spacing rather than glyph stretching.',
